{
  "name": "Salon, spa and gym owners: one city a week from a sheet into checked contacts",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Salon, spa and gym owners: one city a week from a sheet into checked contacts\n\n### How it works\nA steady local pipeline, one city a week. Your cities sheet lists a place and a radius per row. Every Monday the workflow takes the first row without a status, asks Argorant for owners and founders at health, wellness, fitness and beauty companies whose description matches salon, spa, gym or fitness studio within that radius, and reveals up to max_people of them with a work email checked right before you get it. They are appended to your leads sheet, and the city row is marked done with the number found.\n\nCosts: 1 credit per revealed contact with a passing email, capped by max_people a week.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Create a cities sheet (place, radius_miles, status, found) and a leads sheet (date, name, title, company, email, city); pick them in the three sheet nodes.\n4. Set max_people and keywords in **Settings** and activate.\n\n### Customization\nSwap the keywords for barbers, nail studios or yoga studios.",
        "height": 609,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "fa2dbe5e-8e70-4380-8ce3-e9b22efc4449",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    },
